{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14940","headline":"春日喜雨奉和马侍中宴白楼 · 卢纶","name":"春日喜雨奉和马侍中宴白楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹳鹤相呼绿野宽，鼎臣闲倚玉栏干。\n洪河拥沫流仍急，苍岭和云色更寒。\n艳艳风光呈瑞岁，泠泠歌颂振琱盘。\n今朝醉舞共乡老，不觉倾欹獬豸冠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14940.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14940","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}